{
 "group": "voice",
 "title": "Voice: Persian speech + voice cloning (MOSS-TTS-Realtime + Persian LoRA), ambience/effects (MOSS-SoundEffect v2.0), background music (ACE-Step 1.5)",
 "license_note": "Commercial use allowed: MOSS-TTS-Realtime, MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer, MOSS-SoundEffect v2.0 and the Persian LoRA are Apache-2.0 (the LoRA was trained partly on Thomcles/Persian-Farsi-Speech, CC BY 4.0 - keep the credit); ACE-Step 1.5 is MIT and its output may be used commercially. A cloned voice may only be made with the speaker's consent. By default only speech + voice cloning (MOSS-TTS) is installed. Optional: --only moss-sfx (sound effects, ~11 GB) and --only acestep (background music, ~11 GB).",
